ctive-duty military and often deployable, my parents frequently handle school drop-off and pick-up. Amelia is learning Hindi and Telugu at home, so there may occasionally be words or phrases that are unfamiliar.  \n\nAmelia is an eager learner who strives to do her best and takes pride in making her teachers happy.  \n\n---\n\nIf you’d like, I can also make you a **shorter, condensed version** for quick teacher reference while keeping this one for their records. That way they have both a “snapshot” and a “full picture.” Would you like me to prepare that?']
