r the UK leg (more flights, easy transatlantic options); any NYC airport is fine for the Jan 25 return.\n\nIf you tell me the **UK city** (London, Edinburgh, etc.) and rough **times you prefer**, I’ll map a few concrete flight combos that fit these dates and your must-arrive-by-Jan-22 requirement.']
